{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "09 - The specialist",
  "description": "The node that answers or calls tools: prompt, model choice, tool filtering, streaming, and what it returns.",
  "nextTour": "10 - Tools and MCP",
